      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="bc7d-10a5-15e8-e96d">While this squad is on the battlefield, each friendly unit&apos;s weapons with the &apos;dangerous&apos; ability, when resolving the attack pool of misses, only count any 1&apos;s rolled as misses for the &apos;dangerous&apos; ability.</characteristic>
